    "title": "Flo Announce New Album Therapy at the Club, Drop Title Track - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nina Corcoran ,\n13 hours ago Flo are ready to jumpstart a second British invasion with their new album, Therapy at the Club. The follow-up to 2024’s Access All Areas arrives July 24 via Republic. The London-based girl group partnered with a number of powerhouse pop songwriters for the record, including the Grammy-winning Amy Allen and Sabrina Carpenter’s go-to Steph Jones. To ring in the big news, they’ve shared the title track today, too. Check out that new song below. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
